           "text": "What the field says"
          },
          {
           "role": "type.body",
           "bullet_level": 0,
           "text": "Standalone midpoints run from $9.30 (P / TBV comps) to $11.25 (analyst targets); only the precedent set ($11.60) and the synergy DDM ($12.05) centre above the offer"
          },
          {
           "role": "type.body",
           "bullet_level": 0,
           "text": "The 52-week high of $12.40 was set on takeover speculation in August and is not a fundamental anchor"
          },
          {
           "role": "type.body",
           "bullet_level": 0,
           "text": "A re-engagement band of $10.50 to $11.30 sits inside the synergy DDM range and below the offer"
          },
          {
           "role": "type.caption",
           "text": "Ranges exclude the control premium; DDM uses a 1.5% terminal growth rate."
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
